  "created": "2026-11-22T22:46:19.44Z",
  "description": "Foundgine.Providers contains the concrete provider and integration implementations for Foundgine 3.x: SQL and in-memory storage providers, AI/model and MCP tooling integrations, EventStore, outbox and gateway integrations, the Entity Framework Core execution provider and shared ORM core, Redis-protocol shared state (Redis, Valkey, Garnet), the Microsoft Agent Framework adapter, PostgreSQL pgvector and Elasticsearch lexical grounding. The package includes the AOT and ORM source generators as build-time analyzers. EF Core and other third-party libraries are restored as NuGet dependencies and are not bundled as DLLs. Secure GraphQL/Hot Chocolate execution, Temporal and Keycloak live in Foundgine.Extensions. Consumers supply the semantic model and runtime configuration required by Foundgine.",
